    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cabc5eca6be5ca34e28df058",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我往东海帝王的身后看去，\n发现数不清的海参堆成一座小山。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0352b2d69da24a2573609685acb30e4b37919f2e22fd53d908b4b438a7127c4",
